Native SWP plot interval smoke test

The expression below must generate a native rectangular plot with the horizontal line y=1 and the x interval restricted to 0<=x<=1.45.

$$
x\tan x,1
$$
[[swp:plot:2d-rectangular-range:0:1.45]]

The final plot should display only the first positive branch of x tan x over the chosen interval together with the line y=1.
